th fully explorable planets. \n\nInspired by Space Affliction. \n\nCustomize, and command colossal colonies or spawling space stations with a modular building system. \n\nCoordinate with friends to man massive multicrew spaceships featuring fully detailed interiors ranging from humble shuttles to gargantuan space battle ships and aircraft carriers. \n\nMaster physics-based space combat in space fighter jet dogfights or massive warship battles. \n\nGraphics level 9-10 recommended. Private server owners can use commands ('@commands' to list) and admin ships in their private servers but do not earn any exp. ","path":"/game/5747806266-starbase","slug":"5747806266-starbase","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1c11a12198c58733c7d427534daad7a62c55b5076352f0ea47512af7bbfe0a84.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ef8641cc25c258c6f09862b90fe70f4c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":63,"visitor":22568232,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-03-01T03:07:44.307Z","creator":{"name":"Astrabasis Interactive Media","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6328880674,"name":"Lurking Giants [UPDATE]","desc":"There is something that lurks in the TV.\n\n(Verity removed due to copyright)\n\nRemember to report exploiters in the community server!\nBest with friends have fun! 🔥\n\nCredit to Gentoi & Phantox and Dr. Nowhere","path":"/game/6328880674-lurking-giants","slug":"6328880674-lurking-giants","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c393b8c6cbf16d08862311fb8f05ec5751f50cdb5c7765d819049c22b0aff90f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a90bc5237ad57bbad3314b843ea023f5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":63,"visitor":31951031,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-31T09:24:05.132Z","creator":{"name":"ULTRA works","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":72119929635167,"name":"[UPD1] Chess Incremental","desc":"Welcome to Chess Incremental - incremental game with hundreds of Upgrades,\nmultiple Prestige layers and tons to unlock! ✨\n\n♟️ The board plays itself - earn Chess every move!\n⚡ Buy Upgrades and get Stronger!\n💎 Unlock New Currencies!\n🍀 Roll Runes and Ranks, then Level them up!\n🔥 Prestige and unlock new content!\n\n🎁 Code RELEASE for free Tickets and Potions!\n❓ Try to find a SECRET code!\n💖 Like + Favorite for Rune Speed and Rune Luck!\n\nPlus Benefits: +10% Chess & +10% Rune Luck","path":"/game/72119929635167-chess-incremental","slug":"72119929635167-chess-incremental","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a6ee099c605b98b596446cd97d5e2982e9827247de9a070161450ab4da12f78d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e14cbe491d4eaa67f3dd8d147c58fd9a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":63,"visitor":3619729,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-17T07:13:54.585Z","creator":{"name":"3Face","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":3934295745,"name":"[10000] Ultimate Obby 2.0","desc":"before you ask, the game autosaves!\n\nAre you willing to beat the ultimate parkour-filled adventure obstacle course spanning 10000 stages? Ultimate Obby 2.0 is a whole journey across many different areas from the nearby Forgotten Pillars towards the great Tripyramids all the way to the Lost Void. Beware of several different obstacle types the game will present to you obbyists ranging from regular old school lava to reverse phantoms. \n\nThe game starts off as easy and chill like Mega Fun Obby. However, this experience will ultimately get more challenging later on. Progressing further in this obstacle course requires patience and some skill as you will encounter newer types of levels and hazards. Think this is an easy adventure? By level 7823, those thoughts will be long gone...\n\n10000 levels. One Grande Finale. One dog. Good luck on your journey.\n\nThis game has been inspired from \"Mega Fun Obby\", \"Longest Obby in ROBLOX\" as well as references from \"Eternal Towers of Hell\".","path":"/game/3934295745-ultimate-obby-2-0","slug":"3934295745-ultimate-obby-2-0","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b844d2b9bde321a0626dc8df8563fef9ace905b308917a01ee50a36940c9a536.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-06194ffb6fc148b86ba3bbe2a2e12c1f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":63,"visitor":2497528,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T12:26:08.910Z","creator":{"name":"revive_mejett","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13985303823,"name":"Demon Slayer: Burning Ashes","desc":"⚔️This game is NOT beginner friendly.\nYou will get random-killed, punished, and overwhelmed while learning.\nProgress comes from skill, awareness, and mastery — not hand-holding.\n\n🎮 CONTROLS\nQ – Dash\nV – Carry Player\nB – Execute\nM – Menu\nP – Power Sense\n\n🎁 CODES\n!frozenpuritytrailer\n!thanksguys\n!fiveyears\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT\n• VIP Servers DO NOT save data\n• PvP is always on\n• Steep learning curve\n\n\n\nInspired by the popular anime Demon Slayer, this experience focuses on fast-paced combat, movement, and high-risk PvP.\n\n(dsfp  soon guys!)","path":"/game/13985303823-demon-slayer-burning-ashes","slug":"13985303823-demon-slayer-burning-ashes","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/83a01fd6555a911801e5495ab565ec80bed89f195f805a00e51cd7696a9d07e4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9131e859aaeaaa5d2e3fa8844730c5b6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":63,"visitor":38352497,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-11T23:16:47.051Z","creator":{"name":"Burning Ashes: New Era Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4503309821,"name":"[🎃] City Thailand 2","desc":"","path":"/game/4503309821-city-thailand-2","slug":"4503309821-city-thailand-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7c4284ec5eb35c7445be05175f9fde9becbd9a2311054e4c8a74d974102dee4e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-58b57b01242aeb0a0e473c617378b811/150/15